></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Yan</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Molecular characterization of allelic variation at the <italic>VRN-H2 </italic>vernalization locus in barley</article-title><source>Mol Breed</source><year>2005</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>395</fpage><lpage>407</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s11032-005-0084-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karsai</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Sz&#x00171;cs</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>M&#x000e9;sz&#x000e1;ros</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Filichkina</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayes</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Skinner</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>L&#x000e1;ng</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Bed&#x00151;</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The <italic>Vrn-H2 </italic>locus is a major determinant of flowering time in a facultative &#x000d7; winter growth habit barley (<italic>Hordeum vulgare </italic>L.) mapping population</article-title><source>Theor Appl Genet</source><year>2005</year><volume>110</volume><fpage>1458</fpage><lpage>1466</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15834697</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00122-005-1979-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Koebner</surname><given-names>RMD</given-names></name><name><surname>Donini</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Reeves</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooke</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Law</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></